*****************************************************************               Macros used by the DISK][ driver**               Oct 10, 1987 10:10**************************************************************** MACRO&lab _setheartbeat** Stack input for SetHeartBeat is as follows:**               longword   Pointer to task header*           sp->*&lab ldx #$1203 jsl $E10000 MEND MACRO&lab _delheartbeat** Stack input for DelHeartBeat is as follows:**               longword   Pointer to task header*           sp->*&lab ldx #$1303 jsl $E10000 MEND MACRO&lab _longdivide** Stack input for LongDivide is as follows:**               word    space for remainder result*               word    space for quotient result*               long    Numerator*               long    Denominator*           sp->*&lab ldx #$0D0B jsl $E10000 MEND MACRO&lab _fwentry** Stack input for FWentry is as follows:**               word    space for result: Y Register*               word    space for result: X Register*               word    space for result: A Register*               word    space for result: P Register*               word    A Register*               word    X Register*               word    Y Register*               word    Entry point in bank $00*           sp->*&lab ldx #$2403 jsl $E10000 MEND